## Solution to Q1 — City-Level Sales Summary
```sql
select 
  c.city, count(distinct c.customer_id), 
  sum(o.amount), 
  avg(o.amount) 
from customers c
join orders o 
  on c.customer_id = o.customer_id
group by c.city;
```

